  "id": 808,
  "description": "# **Welcome to The**\n# **Hunger Strikers**\n   \nWe are a Semi-Hardcore, team oriented guild that values collaboration, support, commitment and reliability. Our focus is on Raids and Assaults, but we still love to have fun and joke around!\n*Real Life comes first!* We strive to provide a helpful, kind and drama-free enviornment, with the rule that real life always comes first.\n\n===============================\n \n \n## **RULES:**\n\n   1. **Be Active**. Those who are not active within the Guild for a week or more without prior notice will be kicked.\n   2. **Communicate**. Join our Discord. Not doing so will result in a lot of missed information and lack of communication from other members. Otherwise, please DM me with any questions, requests of concerns!\n   3. **Contribute to the Guild** via the stockpile, joining assaults/raids and completing challenges. Those who do not contribute at all will be kicked.\n   4. **Be Kind**. Any racism, homophobia, transhobia or bigotry of any kind will NOT be tolerated. Bullying of any kind will NOT be tolerated.\n\n===============================\n\n\n## **RAID + ASSAULT TIMES**\n\n•We are active between 1300 UTC - 0400 UTC.\n\n•Daily Weekday Raids are at:\n\n    Round ❶: 20:00 UTC\n\n    Round ❷: 21:00 UTC\n\n    Round ❸: 22:00 UTC\n\n•Weekend Assaults are at:\n\n    🏹Hunt: Thursday/Friday, or ASAP\n\n    🗡Fight: 17:00 UTC\n\n===============================\n\n\n## **RAID + ASSAULT INFORMATION**\n\n☆Join raids and assaults for combat and guild experience☆\n\n☆Join assaults/conquests to help us reach higher ranks☆\n\n-We are able to adjust times and CL lvl if necessary.-\n\n•Raid and assault locations vary depending on leveling needs.\n\n•If you have any questions, please dont hesitate to ask! There are no stupid questions. We are here to help!\n\n•We mainly chat in Discord. It is **highly encouraged** to join, otherwise you are missing out on A LOT and could potentially miss very important announcements.\n\n===============================\n\n## **DISCORD**\n\n**Join us on Discord for Raid/Assault Alerts, Contests, Guides and more!:**\nhttps://discord.gg/WSK3ABgMcU",
